The files shared_primes.RSA-<bits>.dat in this directory each hold one integer,
in big-endian bytes: the product of known prime factors shared by RSA moduli
of exactly <bits> bits. They are converted, without other change, from
badkeys/keydata/primes<bits>.dat in the badkeys project
(https://github.com/badkeys/badkeys), as of commit
517c44610d77fa59bf4ead0430565ae93c306d29 (2022-03-31, "update gcd primes"),
which stores the same products in gmpy2's binary format. They are distributed
under the following license.

